        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "I am calling to apologise for the delay in sending the report."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "No problem. I understand you were very busy last week."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "I will submit the completed report by tomorrow morning."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Thank you. Could you also send a digital copy by email?"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "Of course. I will attach it to my email tonight."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "If you had called earlier, I would have helped you."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "I understand. I should have contacted you sooner."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "No need to worry. I look forward to receiving the report."
      }
    ]
  },
